---
import TimeCalculator from './TimeCalculator.astro';
---
<section id="como-funciona" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="badge-tag navy">El Dilema del Receso Universitario</div>
      <h2>Por qué perder tu descanso haciendo fila</h2>
      <p>Tu tiempo libre entre clases vale oro. uniFud transforma 25 minutos de espera en 20 segundos de recogida directa.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-grid">
      <!-- The Old Way -->
      <div class="comparison-card bad">
        <div class="comparison-card-badge">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg>
          <span>La forma tradicional</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Esperar en la cafetería</h3>
        <ul class="comparison-list">
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
            <span>20 a 30 minutos de pie durante las horas pico (12:00m a 2:00pm).</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
            <span>Comes de afán y con estrés para no llegar tarde a tu siguiente clase.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
            <span>Muchas veces se agota tu plato preferido antes de que logres llegar a la caja.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- The uniFud Way -->
      <div class="comparison-card good">
        <div class="comparison-card-badge">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          <span>Con uniFud</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Pre-ordena y recoge sin filas</h3>
        <ul class="comparison-list">
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Pides con 10 minutos de anticipación desde el celular antes de terminar clase.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Recibes una alerta automática por WhatsApp cuando tu comida esté empacada y caliente.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Llegas, muestras tu confirmación y recoges en barra en 20 segundos.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <TimeCalculator />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .comparison-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .comparison-card {
    padding: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    border: 2px solid var(--border-card);
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .comparison-card.bad {
    border-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.25);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FFF5F5 100%);
  }
  .comparison-card.good {
    border-color: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.35);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #F0FDF4 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.08);
  }
  .comparison-card-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .comparison-card.bad .comparison-card-badge {
    background: var(--coral-100);
    color: var(--coral-500);
  }
  .comparison-card.good .comparison-card-badge {
    background: var(--mint-100);
    color: var(--mint-600);
  }
  .comparison-card h3 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }
  .comparison-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .comparison-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .comparison-list li svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .comparison-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .comparison-card {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .comparison-card {
      padding: 24px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }
    .comparison-card h3 {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .comparison-list {
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .comparison-list li {
      font-size: 14px;
      gap: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>
